# Stage-3 launch flags (ACP agent, 2026-11-13, state/acp.md 17k), sourced by ops/auto_stage3.sh at the switch.
# @ANCHOR@ = the stage-2 checkpoint's iteration: eta_obs = eta_rew = 1 carried from stage 2 (both are 1 at the switch; no jump).
# --s3-paper 1: success 0.5 m / 0.1 m, 0.2 m cut, TileReplay (per tile, work-per-metre eviction, types -> tiles -> steps), yaw +-0.4,
# phase 0, Table 3 stumbling / slippage, qualifying demotion distance, V_fs clipping off in the 500-iteration warm-up.
# Data: the stage-2h reference sets unchanged + goal tiles v2b (our 6 families + extended map, no ladders / vaults) on one raster.
S3_ENVV="X2_EXCLUDE_PAIRS=hip ACP_PLANT=mc_20261024 ACP_HF_FIX=1 ACP_PAPER_DR=1"
S3_DATA=cfg/stage3v2h_sets.json
S3_EX="--stage 3 --s3-paper 1 --planner-arch attn --u-obs 200 --u-rew 1700 --n-ann 6000 --eta-anchor-it @ANCHOR@ --eta-obs0 1 --eta-rew0 1 --goal-share 0.5 --s3-warmup 500 --probe-envs 720 --gate-signal probe --ramp-gate 0"
